00:05:58.059 --> 00:06:00.630
- Before you start
rooting around for money,

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.880
make sure running a
business is something you

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.000
really carrot all for.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:05.833
Check out our video,

